# Supabase project credentials (Dashboard > Project Settings > API).
# The anon key is public by design; the database is protected by the
# Row Level Security rules in supabase/schema.sql.
# On Netlify, set these under Site configuration > Environment variables.
# Leave them empty to run in offline mode (data stays in the browser).
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=""
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=""
